# hypernix.new_range

Zero-dep first-fail labeling rubric — lightest scoring tier.

## Documentation pages

- [Ranges](../../#/docs/Ranges) · [MDXL source](pages/Ranges.mdxl)

## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `math_lacks_digit(prompt, response) -> bool`

True if the prompt looks numeric and the response has no digits.

### `is_repetition(prompt, response, min_run=8) -> bool`

True if the same character or short token repeats `min_run` times.

### `NewRange()`

First-fail rubric labeler.

### `default_rules() -> Iterable[Rule]`

The out-of-the-box rule set used when no explicit ``rules`` is given.

### `new_range(rules=None) -> NewRange`

Construct a :class:`NewRange` with the given rules (or the defaults).

